<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech c. bank 1-wk repo average yield 14.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Czech c. bank 1-wk repo average yield 14.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech National Bank (CNB) said on Tuesday that the average and maximum yield in a one-week reverse repo operation to drain liquidity was unchanged at 14.5 percent at which all bids were accepted.</p>
<p>Minimum accepted yield was 14.49 percent.</p>
<p>-- Robin Shepherd, Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
